{"page":223,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:13","surah":11,"ayah":13,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ يَقُولُونَ ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ ۖ قُلْ فَأْتُوا۟ بِعَشْرِ سُوَرٍ مِّثْلِهِۦ مُفْتَرَيَـٰتٍ وَٱدْعُوا۟ مَنِ ٱسْتَطَعْتُم مِّن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ إِن كُنتُمْ صَـٰدِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If they say, ‘He has invented it himself,’ say, ‘Then produce ten invented suras like it, and call in whoever you can beside God, if you are truthful.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":3,"ar":"افْتَرَاهُ ۖ","en_gloss":"He has fabricated it","transliteration":"if'tarāhu","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَأْتُوا۟","en_gloss":"Then bring","transliteration":"fatū","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِعَشْرِ","en_gloss":"ten","transliteration":"biʿashri","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سُوَرٍۢ","en_gloss":"Surahs","transliteration":"suwarin","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّثْلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"like it","transliteration":"mith'lihi","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُفْتَرَيَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"fabricated","transliteration":"muf'tarayātin","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱدْعُوا۟","en_gloss":"and call","transliteration":"wa-id'ʿū","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَنِ","en_gloss":"whoever","transliteration":"mani","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱسْتَطَعْتُم","en_gloss":"you can","transliteration":"is'taṭaʿtum","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"besides Allah","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":14,"ar":"دُونِ","en_gloss":"besides Allah","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"besides Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"11:13"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"yo