ot be lessened","transliteration":"yub'khasūna","verse_key":"11:15"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٥","en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:15"}]},{"verse_key":"11:16","surah":11,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ ٱلَّذِينَ لَيْسَ لَهُمْ فِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ إِلَّا ٱلنَّارُ ۖ وَحَبِطَ مَا صَنَعُوا۟ فِيهَا وَبَـٰطِلٌ مَّا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but such people will have nothing in the Hereafter but the Fire: their work here will be fruitless and their deeds futile.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) the ones who ","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَيْسَ","en_gloss":"(is) not","transliteration":"laysa","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلنَّارُ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāru","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَحَبِطَ","en_gloss":"And (has) gone in vain","transliteration":"waḥabiṭa","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"صَنَعُوا۟","en_gloss":"they did","transliteration":"ṣanaʿū","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَبَـٰطِلٌۭ","en_gloss":"and (is) worthless","transliteration":"wabāṭilun","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used (to)","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"11:16"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"do",